``xia2.ssx``/``xia2.ssx_reduce``: Add a ``series_repeat=`` option, which generalises ``dose_series_repeat=`` by allowing the groups of a repeated series of measurements to be named, e.g. ``series_repeat=first,second,last``. The number of names defines the size of the repeat, and the names are used for the merged output files in place of ``dose_1``, ``dose_2``, ... A name may be repeated, in which case each occurrence is numbered in order, i.e. ``series_repeat=dose,dose,apo`` gives ``dose_1``, ``dose_2`` and ``apo``.
